WEBVTT

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.676
So these guys, you see them.

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:34.884
You see, I, Sam Richards --
I know who these guys are.

00:11:34.908 --> 00:11:37.841
They're my students, my friends;
I know what they're thinking.

00:11:37.865 --> 00:11:39.073
You don't know.

00:11:39.097 --> 00:11:41.642
When you see them, they're something else.

00:11:42.426 --> 00:11:43.700
They're something else.

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:45.866
That's what they are to you.

00:11:46.908 --> 00:11:49.375
We don't see it that way
in the United States,

00:11:49.399 --> 00:11:50.835
but you see it that way.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:55.867
So here.

00:11:56.501 --> 00:11:58.533
Of course, you've got it wrong.

00:11:58.557 --> 00:12:01.040
You're generalizing. It's wrong.